# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Google Sign-In (optional)
#
# To enable "Continue with Google" on /login:
#   1. Open https://console.cloud.google.com
#   2. Create a project (or pick one), then go to:
#        APIs & Services → Credentials → Create Credentials → OAuth client ID
#   3. Application type: Web application
#      Authorized JavaScript origins:
#        - http://localhost:5173       (Vite dev server)
#        - https://your-prod-domain    (production deploy)
#   4. Copy the Client ID and paste it below, then rename this file to `.env`.
#   5. Restart `npm run dev`.
#
# If you leave this blank the login page still loads, but only "Continue as
# guest" is offered — the Google button is hidden with a friendly notice.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
